OL,3,GNEWSAPolice watchdog calls for live
OL,4,Afacial recognition to tackle football
OL,5,Adisorder
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe head of the Scottish police
OL,8,Fwatchdog is calling for the
OL,9,Fintroduction of live facial recognition
OL,10,Ftechnology and drones to help combat
OL,11,Ffootball-related disorder.
OL,13,FHM Chief Inspector of Constabulary in
OL,14,FScotland (HMICS) Craig Naylor has used
OL,15,Fthe publication of his annual report to
OL,16,Fhighlight the need for better use of
OL,17,Ftechnology to help fight crime.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
