OL,3,GNEWSAPolice watchdog calls for live
OL,4,Afacial recognition to tackle football
OL,5,Adisorder
OL,6,
OL,7,FNaylor described recent football
OL,8,Fviolence, like the disorder between
OL,9,FCeltic and Rangers fans at Ibrox in
OL,10,FMarch, as "a situation that cannot
OL,11,Fcontinue to be tolerated."
OL,13,FHe also said the increasing violence in
OL,14,FScotland outside football grounds was
OL,15,Flikely to require more police
OL,16,Fdeployments.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
